     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Concession",
     "texto": [
      "**Deși plouă, mergem pe jos** means \"Although it rains, we walk\". Do not add **dar** (\"but\") to the same structure with **deși**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Consumption",
     "texto": [
      "**Economisesc** means \"I save\"; **refolosesc**, \"I reuse\". You can talk about a responsible action even when the situation is not ideal."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
